Turbo Thruster — license and attribution
========================================

Turbo Thruster is a from-scratch, cross-platform recreation of
**Torus Trooper** by **Kenta Cho** (ABA Games, circa 2004).  The original
game's design, gameplay and assets are Copyright 2004 Kenta Cho.

This recreation reuses the original *music and sound-effect assets*
(``assets/sounds/``) and follows the original gameplay and visual style,
which are distributed under the following permissive license (reproduced from
the original ``readme.txt``):

